<title>FRANCE: Rouen Nov flour exports rose year-on-year.</title>
<headline>Rouen Nov flour exports rose year-on-year.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen rose to 56,333 tonnes in November 1996 from 31,000 tonnes in November 1995, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Some 25,317 tonnes of flour were destined for western Africa, 11,000 tonnes for Libya and 20,016 tonnes for Yemen, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
